ry about it, too.  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm not sure I want more writing.  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hmm ...<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: The web designer has been making my work easy since we started!  The blogs have been flying out for a while now!", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn7le18ob09re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Have you had many hits?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, I've had quite a few. What should I do about the comments? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You could comment back here and there. You should ask questions about how their stuff turned out. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Don't you think that could be bad if it went wrong?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: No. Give advice. You ought to ask your followers for photos for the gallery.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Correct me if I'm wrong, but they could be terrible!", "time": "23000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn7le18ob09re2img03.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You should just post the good ones! You've been sorting through them, right?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah. I'm going to post our rice dishes this weekend.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Everyone will love them!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm not sure I agree with you. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You can't worry about that. People like what they like. Just keep on posting. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah. That's what I've been thinking.", "time": "44700", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}